{"name":"Blue Beetle","hex":"#220099","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blue","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a blue hue.","Depressed, melancholic, sad."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour of the clear sky or the deep sea; the colour midway between green and violet in the visible spectrum and one of the primary additive colours.","Anything coloured blue, especially to distinguish it from similar objects differing only in colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blue"},{"term":"beetle","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of numerous species of insect in the order Coleoptera characterized by a pair of hard, shell-like front wings which cover and protect a pair of rear wings when at rest.","A game of chance in which players attempt to complete a drawing of a beetle, different dice rolls allowing them to add the various body parts."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To move (away) quickly, to scurry away."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beetle"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blue Beetle","blocks":[{"text":"Blue Beetle is the name of three superheroes appearing in a number of American comic books published by a variety of companies since 1939. The most recent of the companies to own rights to Blue Beetle is DC Comics, which bought the rights to the character from Charlton Comics in 1983, using the name for three distinct characters over the years."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/49/BlueBeetles.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Beetle","wikidata":"Q885626"},{"title":"Blue Beetle (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Blue Beetle is a 2023 American superhero film based on the DC Comics character Jaime Reyes / Blue Beetle. Directed by Ángel Manuel Soto and written by Gareth Dunnet-Alcocer, it is the 14th film in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU). Xolo Maridueña stars as Reyes, a recent college graduate who is granted superpowers by an ancient alien relic known as the Scarab. Adriana Barraza, Damián Alcázar, Raoul Max Trujillo, Susan Sarandon, and George Lopez also star in the film. John Rickard and Zev Foreman produced the film for DC Films and Warner Bros. Pictures."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/68/Blue_Beetle_%28film%29_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Beetle_(film)","wikidata":"Q107808351"},{"title":"Beetle","blocks":[{"text":"Beetles are insects that form the order Coleoptera, in the superorder Holometabola. Their front pair of wings are hardened into wing-cases, elytra, distinguishing them from most other insects. The Coleoptera, with about 400,000 described species, is the largest of all orders, constituting almost 40% of described arthropods and 25% of all known animal species; new species are discovered frequently, with estimates suggesting that there are between 0.9 and 2.1 million total species."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Coleoptera_collage.png/330px-Coleoptera_collage.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beetle","wikidata":"Q22671"},{"title":"Blue","blocks":[{"text":"Blue is one of the three primary colours in the RGB (additive) colour model, as well as in the RYB colour model. It lies between violet and cyan on the spectrum of visible light. The term blue generally describes colours perceived by humans observing light with a dominant wavelength between approximately 450 and 495 nanometres. The clear daytime sky and the deep sea appear blue because of an optical effect known as Rayleigh scattering. An optical effect called the Tyndall effect explains blue eyes. Distant objects appear more blue because of another optical effect called aerial perspective."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg/330px-Earth-in-true-color-himawari-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue","wikidata":"Q1088"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Angel_Manuel_Soto_01.jpg/500px-Angel_Manuel_Soto_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Angel_Manuel_Soto_01.jpg/500px-Angel_Manuel_Soto_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ángel Manuel Soto, the director of Blue Beetle","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAngel_Manuel_Soto_01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Xolo_Mariduena_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2024.jpg/500px-Xolo_Mariduena_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Xolo_Mariduena_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2024.jpg/500px-Xolo_Mariduena_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2024.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AXolo_Mariduena_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2024.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Marquezine_by_Arezzo_01.jpg/500px-Marquezine_by_Arezzo_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Marquezine_by_Arezzo_01.jpg/500px-Marquezine_by_Arezzo_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMarquezine_by_Arezzo_01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/George_Lopez_2019.jpg/120px-George_Lopez_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_cam